Morph 3D - Shows morphing platonic polyhedra
Author: Marcelo Fernandes Vianna (vianna@cat.cbpf.br)

  [1]    - Tetrahedron
  [2]    - Hexahedron (Cube)
  [3]    - Octahedron
  [4]    - Dodecahedron
